sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as RHOAI Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrainerOp as trainer-operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Manifests as Manifest Templates<br/>(/opt/manifests-template/)
    participant TrainerCtrl as kubeflow-trainer-<br/>controller-manager
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>443/TCP → 9443/TCP TLS
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant JobSetCtrl as JobSet Controller

    rect rgb(230, 230, 250)
        Note over PlatformOp,TrainerOp: Flow 1: Trainer Component Lifecycle
        PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR (default-trainer)<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: Watch event: Trainer CR created
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Check JobSet Operator installed<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: JobSetOperator CR status
        alt JobSet Not Ready
            TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Set Trainer CR → Degraded<br/>Requeue 60s
        end
        TrainerOp->>Manifests: Copy templates to /opt/manifests-work
        TrainerOp->>TrainerOp: Render kustomize with<br/>RELATED_IMAGE_* overrides
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Apply CRDs (TrainJob,<br/>ClusterTrainingRuntime, TrainingRuntime)<br/>Server-Side Apply
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Apply RBAC, Deployment,<br/>Services, Webhooks<br/>Server-Side Apply
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Apply ClusterTrainingRuntimes<br/>(torch-distributed CUDA/ROCm/CPU)
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Apply ImageStreams<br/>(OpenShift only)
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerCtrl: Deployment created → Pod starts
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Monitor Deployment health<br/>Bearer Token
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status<br/>Ready/ProvisioningSucceeded
    end

    rect rgb(250, 240, 230)
        Note over User,JobSetCtrl: Flow 2: TrainJob Execution (operand)
        User->>K8sAPI: Create TrainJob CR<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate TrainJob<br/>HTTPS/TLS (webhook cert)
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
        K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerCtrl: Watch event: TrainJob created
        TrainerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Read ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Bearer Token
        TrainerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet from<br/>TrainJob + Runtime template<br/>Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>JobSetCtrl: Watch event: JobSet created
        JobSetCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Jobs/Pods for<br/>distributed training workers
    end
